# Vertical velocity omega (Pa/s). NEGATIVE = upward motion (synoptic
# lift) in warm colors; positive = subsidence in blues; transparent
# band around zero so quiet air shows the map.
nv    0   0   0   0
-3    200 30  120 255
-2    240 80  40  240
-1.2  250 160 60  200
-0.6  250 220 120 150
-0.2  255 255 255 0
0.2   255 255 255 0
0.6   170 200 230 130
1.5   110 150 210 190
3     60  90  180 240
